Subject: [PATCH 3/5] =?UTF-8?q?CEOwills:=20Sofian's=201=20Oct=20notes,=20s?=
 =?UTF-8?q?econd=20pass=20video=20by=20video=20=E2=80=94=20tighter=20pause?=
 =?UTF-8?q?s,=20captions=20on=20time,=20#14=20exposure,=20#16=20title?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- pauses.py: voiced sound only protects a word when it reaches word level (word_voiced) — the breathed-out hum
  between phrases is a pause now; lone clicks/smacks/in-breaths at a piece's edge are dropped, judged by the sound of
  the next/previous word; the first piece is tightened too (#12 opened on 0.3 s of air before "If")
- render.py: a word that starts in its shot is no longer moved to the next shot as a zero-length caption
  ("circumvented" vanished in #2; 7 of 9 videos showed a word late); per-job "tone" (exposure + highlight shoulder)
- #14: exposure/whites down a little (Sofian 18:36) — face highlights 240 → 218, no clipping
- #16: title "Nothing written down? / Here's why you need to / be safe than sorry" (Eyad), hook_question allowed
- #10: caption typo "has a implication" → "has an implication"
- jobs re-cut, tracker versions: #2 v9, #6 v12, #7 v12, #9 v9, #10 v8, #12 v8, #14 v7, #16 v8, #17 v15

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
